[E]and ev'ry knee will bow before Him.
[E]Our God is the Lamb, the Lamb [Bsus4]that was slain
[C#m7]for the sin of the world; His [Bsus4]blood breaks the chains.
[A]And ev'ry knee will bow before the [Bsus4]Lion and the Lamb.
[A]Ev'ry knee will bow [Bsus4]before Him.
{end_of_chorus}

